            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-19T06:56:01.205845+00:00",
            "notes": "[[Scientific Deathod](item_d61c724d-0a3e-4a28-bfb5-a7859b799981) Is where this build shines and allows you to harass the backline, all while standing in the middle of the enemy team.. if you so choose. Shoot [Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1) wait a second, then fade through enemy frontline to stack Overhealth. Once your fade ends your healing orb would have caught up to you and you just right click enemies to transfer their life force to yourself. Then you can just keep repeating, keeping in mind to fade through enemies with each fade. I have stood against teams and been able to hold points solo doing this.\n\n**Make sure to have your ultimate up before hard diving for the extra sustain from [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f)**",
